 · Files · inspect, compare, transform and extract from files · Files · file identity, permissions, parser/tool result · 
 · Data · analyze datasets, statistics, charts and simulations · Data · dataset lineage, computation result, validation ·','docs/FRESH_AI_CAPABILITY_PRODUCT_CONTRACT.md','d1c144366bf2cdbc'),
 ('Doc: FRESH_AI_CAPABILITY_PRODUCT_CONTRACT — Capability matrix (part 2/3)','Per docs/FRESH_AI_CAPABILITY_PRODUCT_CONTRACT.md (Fresh AI Capability & Product Contract (#TRUEMODE)), section "Capability matrix": · Code · generate, run, test, debug, review and explain code · Code · repository/workspace, execution permission, test evidence · 
 · Projects · persistent chats, files, instructions, memory and artifacts · Projects · project scope, memory scope, source lineage · 
