 ('Doc: FRESH_POWERS_MISSIONS_MAP — 1. The 14 powers, matched to the master matrix (part 2/2)','Per docs/FRESH_POWERS_MISSIONS_MAP.md (Fresh powers and missions map), section "1. The 14 powers, matched to the master matrix": because native-generation was added. Both are kept.','docs/FRESH_POWERS_MISSIONS_MAP.md','b1210c47182ac5d2'),
 ('Doc: FRESH_POWERS_MISSIONS_MAP — 2. Ecosystem status (from the master matrix)','Per docs/FRESH_POWERS_MISSIONS_MAP.md (Fresh powers and missions map), section "2. Ecosystem status (from the master matrix)": In progress: 1 Core Foundation, 2 Fresh Intelligence, 3 Fresh Flow, 5 Creation,
