 ('Doc: FRESH_POWERS_MISSIONS_MAP — 3. Overlapping systems (kept, not deleted)','Per docs/FRESH_POWERS_MISSIONS_MAP.md (Fresh powers and missions map), section "3. Overlapping systems (kept, not deleted)": These parallel structures exist in the live database. Recommended canonical
choice is listed; migrate readers to it with adapter views before retiring any.
 · Area · Systems found · Recommended canonical · 
