 ('Doc: FRESH_RUNTIME_CAPABILITY_MATRIX — Verification rule','Per docs/FRESH_RUNTIME_CAPABILITY_MATRIX.md (Fresh Runtime Capability Matrix), section "Verification rule": A feature is implemented only when code executes a real browser/server API or deployed service, the result is observable, failure is surfaced, successful state is persisted where required, and a build/runtime check verifies the path. Architecture interfaces alone do not satisfy this rule.','docs/FRESH_RUNTIME_CAPABILITY_MATRIX.md','bd20b8ce220ffcf0'),
