 ('Doc: FRESH_WEB_LITE_FINAL_MASTER_SPEC — Part A — Ecosystem coverage (nothing left behind) (part 2/2)','Per docs/FRESH_WEB_LITE_FINAL_MASTER_SPEC.md (Fresh Web Lite — Final Master Specification), section "Part A — Ecosystem coverage (nothing left behind)": · 22 · Security & Trust · Every phase · Critical · 
 · 23 · Design System · P0+ · Critical · 
